      "noteEn": "Ni normally adds a negative alternative or emphasis. In the short fixed reply ni idea, the whole expression means “no idea.”",
      "example": { "es": "No tengo ni idea.", "en": "I have no idea." },
      "tags": ["word", "negative", "fixed expression", "A2"]
